"setoptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"setOptions()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"setOptions(options): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L107","children":[{"type":"text","value":"controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:107"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Updates the recorder options (e.g. callbacks)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Partial"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HotkeyRecorderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-7","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"startrecording","children":[{"type":"text","value":"startRecording()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"startRecording(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L112","children":[{"type":"text","value":"controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:112"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Start recording a new hotkey."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-8","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"stoprecording","children":[{"type":"text","value":"stopRecording()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"stopRecording(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L117","children":[{"type":"text","value":"controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:117"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Stop recording (same as cancel but without calling onCancel)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-9","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"implements","text":"Implements","level":2},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"host","text":"_host","level":5},{"id":"options","text":"_options","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"accessors","text":"Accessors","level":2},{"id":"isrecording","text":"isRecording","level":3},{"id":"get-signature","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"recordedhotkey","text":"recordedHotkey","level":3},{"id":"get-signature-2","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"cancelrecording","text":"cancelRecording()","level":3},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"hostconnected","text":"hostConnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"hostdisconnected","text":"hostDisconnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-2","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"setoptions","text":"setOptions()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options-2","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"startrecording","text":"startRecording()","level":3},{"id":"returns-8","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"stoprecording","text":"stopRecording()","level":3},{"id":"returns-9","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L40)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that records keyboard shortcuts.\n\nWraps the framework-agnostic `HotkeyRecorder` class, managing all the\ncomplexity of capturing keyboard events, converting them to hotkey strings,\nand handling edge cases like Escape to cancel or Backspace/Delete to clear.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass ShortcutSettings extends LitElement {\n  private recorder = new HotkeyRecorderController(this, {\n    onRecord: (hotkey) => {\n      this.shortcut = hotkey\n      this.requestUpdate()\n    },\n    onCancel: () => {\n      console.log('Recording cancelled')\n    },\n  })\n\n  private shortcut: Hotkey | null = null\n\n  render() {\n    return html`\n      <button @click=${() => this.recorder.startRecording()}>\n        ${this.recorder.isRecording ? 'Recording...' : 'Edit Shortcut'}\n      </button>\n      ${this.recorder.recordedHotkey\n        ? html`<div>Recording: ${this.recorder.recordedHotkey}</div>`\n        : nothing}\n    `\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HotkeyRecorderController(_host, _options): HotkeyRecorderController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:65](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L65)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit component that owns this controller.\n\n##### \\_options\n\n`HotkeyRecorderOptions` \\| (() => `HotkeyRecorderOptions`)\n\nOptions or a getter, read during recording.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HotkeyRecorderController`\n\n## Accessors\n\n### isRecording\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget isRecording(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:52](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L52)\n\nWhether recording is currently active.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n***\n\n### recordedHotkey\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget recordedHotkey(): Hotkey | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L57)\n\nThe currently recorded hotkey (for live preview).\n\n##### Returns\n\n`Hotkey` \\| `null`\n\n## Methods\n\n### cancelRecording()\n\n```ts\ncancelRecording(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:122](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L122)\n\nCancel recording without saving.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:79](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L79)\n\nSubscribes to the recorder store and updates the internal state when changes occur.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:98](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L98)\n\nUnsubscribes from the recorder store and destroys the recorder instance to prevent memory leaks.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### setOptions()\n\n```ts\nsetOptions(options): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:107](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L107)\n\nUpdates the recorder options (e.g. callbacks).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`Partial`\\<`HotkeyRecorderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### startRecording()\n\n```ts\nstartRecording(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:112](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L112)\n\nStart recording a new hotkey.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### stopRecording()\n\n```ts\nstopRecording(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:117](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L117)\n\nStop recording (same as cancel but without calling onCancel).\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HotkeyRecorderController\ntitle: HotkeyRecorderController\n---\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L40)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that records keyboard shortcuts.\n\nWraps the framework-agnostic `HotkeyRecorder` class, managing all the\ncomplexity of capturing keyboard events, converting them to hotkey strings,\nand handling edge cases like Escape to cancel or Backspace/Delete to clear.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass ShortcutSettings extends LitElement {\n  private recorder = new HotkeyRecorderController(this, {\n    onRecord: (hotkey) => {\n      this.shortcut = hotkey\n      this.requestUpdate()\n    },\n    onCancel: () => {\n      console.log('Recording cancelled')\n    },\n  })\n\n  private shortcut: Hotkey | null = null\n\n  render() {\n    return html`\n      <button @click=${() => this.recorder.startRecording()}>\n        ${this.recorder.isRecording ? 'Recording...' : 'Edit Shortcut'}\n      </button>\n      ${this.recorder.recordedHotkey\n        ? html`<div>Recording: ${this.recorder.recordedHotkey}</div>`\n        : nothing}\n    `\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HotkeyRecorderController(_host, _options): HotkeyRecorderController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:65](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L65)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit component that owns this controller.\n\n##### \\_options\n\n`HotkeyRecorderOptions` \\| (() => `HotkeyRecorderOptions`)\n\nOptions or a getter, read during recording.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HotkeyRecorderController`\n\n## Accessors\n\n### isRecording\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget isRecording(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:52](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L52)\n\nWhether recording is currently active.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n***\n\n### recordedHotkey\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget recordedHotkey(): Hotkey | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L57)\n\nThe currently recorded hotkey (for live preview).\n\n##### Returns\n\n`Hotkey` \\| `null`\n\n## Methods\n\n### cancelRecording()\n\n```ts\ncancelRecording(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:122](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L122)\n\nCancel recording without saving.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:79](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L79)\n\nSubscribes to the recorder store and updates the internal state when changes occur.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:98](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L98)\n\nUnsubscribes from the recorder store and destroys the recorder instance to prevent memory leaks.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### setOptions()\n\n```ts\nsetOptions(options): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:107](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L107)\n\nUpdates the recorder options (e.g. callbacks).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`Partial`\\<`HotkeyRecorderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### startRecording()\n\n```ts\nstartRecording(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:112](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L112)\n\nStart recording a new hotkey.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### stopRecording()\n\n```ts\nstopRecording(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts:117](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-recorder.ts#L117)\n\nStop recording (same as cancel but without calling onCancel).\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
